   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Mostly before release, but also on checkpoints as training scales. They test for dangerous capabilities (CBRN, cyber, autonomy)\nand alignment problems (deception, sabotage). The results decide the ASL level, which decides what safeguards have to be in place before release.",
   "originalText": "Mostly before release, but also on checkpoints as training scales. They test for dangerous capabilities (CBRN, cyber, autonomy)\nand alignment problems (deception, sabotage). The results decide the ASL level, which decides what safeguards have to be in place before release.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
